WEBVTT

00:08:27.412 --> 00:08:30.760
huge sums of money,
transformational sums of money,

00:08:30.784 --> 00:08:32.806
from poor countries.

00:08:32.830 --> 00:08:36.226
In virtually every case of corruption
that we've investigated,

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:38.438
shell companies have appeared,

00:08:38.462 --> 00:08:40.798
and sometimes
it's been impossible to find out

00:08:40.822 --> 00:08:44.310
who is really involved in the deal.

00:08:44.334 --> 00:08:46.638
A recent study by the World Bank

00:08:46.662 --> 00:08:49.588
looked at 200 cases of corruption.

00:08:49.612 --> 00:08:52.678
It found that over 70
percent of those cases

00:08:52.702 --> 00:08:55.632
had used anonymous shell companies,

00:08:55.656 --> 00:08:59.014
totaling almost 56 billion dollars.

00:08:59.038 --> 00:09:01.276
Now many of these
companies were in America